# Phone held sideways (DPR 3): the Daily challenge by touch, slides by keys, a hint, the pause sheet with the 3D board switched off (the flat board), Resume, a swipe on the flat board, the 3D board back on, Leave run.
# viewport 844x390@3
# The six key slides are placeholders that tests/native.mjs fills from the rules for today's Daily board, so each is legal and the swipe up after them moves tiles.
until 300 =Play
frames 150
touch Daily challenge
until 120 Objective
frames 60
key {{M1}} 1
until 60 Moves 1
key {{M2}} 1
until 60 Moves 2
key {{M3}} 1
until 60 Moves 3
key {{M4}} 1
until 60 Moves 4
key {{M5}} 1
until 60 Moves 5
key {{M6}} 1
until 60 Moves 6
touch =Hint
frames 20
save land-play
touch =Pause
until 60 Paused
frames 10
save land-pause
touch =3D board (WebGL)
frames 10
touch =Resume
frames 20
# up: tests/native.mjs picks the slides so that up is legal here
swipe 50% 85% 50% 40% 6
frames 20
save land-flat
expect Moves 7
key Escape 1
until 60 Paused
frames 10
touch =3D board (WebGL)
frames 5
touch =Leave run
until 60 Resume run
frames 10
